    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WHAT IS DEATH REMAINS?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Death Remains</strong> is a relentless open-world survival game where the dead never rest\u2014and neither do you. Face off against overwhelming zombie hordes and ever-shifting factions in a world where permadeath forces you to choose wisely at every turn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986460/extras/b0b3c7bb175612500a5f7cac9a2ba09e.avif?t=1741280786\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HOW YOU PLAY!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you dive into online multiplayer on player-run servers hosting up to 100 players or team up in local co-op for up to four, the challenge is real. Roam vast landscapes where day gives way to night, winter encroaches, and nature slowly reclaims deserted cities. Experience dynamic events such as reactivating power plants and transforming trains into mobile bases for transport and supplies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your survival hinges on every choice\u2014from scavenging for scarce resources and crafting weapons to constructing fortified shelters by felling trees and sawing wood. Navigate treacherous terrain in physics-driven vehicles while honing your skills in carpentry, cooking, farming, fishing, and more\u2014all while battling hunger, thirst, illness, and other hardships.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986460/extras/34953d7ea4d8ad22f77857d45b4c692a.poster.avif?t=1741280786\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986460/extras/34953d7ea4d8ad22f77857d45b4c692a.webm?t=1741280786\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986460/extras/34953d7ea4d8ad22f77857d45b4c692a.mp4?t=1741280786\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FACTION SYSTEM - NEVER BE ALONE AND BORED</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world comes alive with diverse NPCs and factions. Some offer alliances or trade, while others have their sights set on your demise. Engage in everything from tense negotiations to fierce combat, and even hunt local wildlife to supplement your supplies. Every interaction adds a unique twist to your survival tale.\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986460/extras/9e780f7028e789d96398698bc4cef4ad.avif?t=1741280786\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MODDING SUPPORT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For creative minds, Death Remains will launch with full modding support, giving you the power to reshape the experience and share your unique creations with the community. From custom scripts to entirely new features, you\u2019ll have the freedom to mold this unforgiving world to your liking. A comprehensive documentation will be available at release, guiding you step by step in bringing your ideas to life.\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<br>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986460/extras/6a87fe4b07d3c6f3df2024617cd03f7e.poster.avif?t=1741280786\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986460/extras/6a87fe4b07d3c6f3df2024617cd03f7e.webm?t=1741280786\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986460/extras/6a87fe4b07d3c6f3df2024617cd03f7e.mp4?t=1741280786\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WHAT YOU GET</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong>For those new to this brutal realm, a brief story mode offers a gripping introduction, teaching you the survival basics while immersing you in the harsh realities of <i>Death Remains</i>. Choose how you want to play:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Singleplayer Tutorial</strong>: Learn the ropes at your own pace.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Co-op</strong>: Team up with friends to endure the dangers together.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiplayer</strong>: Put your survival instincts to the test in high-stakes encounters against other players.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join our Discord for more information!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986460/extras/d2b15f2c7bc0d98c713734b5264aecbb.poster.avif?t=1741280786\" width=688 height=386 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986460/extras/d2b15f2c7bc0d98c713734b5264aecbb.webm?t=1741280786\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986460/extras/d2b15f2c7bc0d98c713734b5264aecbb.mp4?t=1741280786\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986460/extras/f016f06502ba92c4b950fb707ce0f2d0.poster.avif?t=1741280786\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986460/extras/f016f06502ba92c4b950fb707ce0f2d0.webm?t=1741280786\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986460/extras/f016f06502ba92c4b950fb707ce0f2d0.mp4?t=1741280786\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WHAT IS DEATH REMAINS?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Death Remains</strong> is a relentless open-world survival game where the dead never rest\u2014and neither do you. Face off against overwhelming zombie hordes and ever-shifting factions in a world where permadeath forces you to choose wisely at every turn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986460/extras/b0b3c7bb175612500a5f7cac9a2ba09e.avif?t=1741280786\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HOW YOU PLAY!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you dive into online multiplayer on player-run servers hosting up to 100 players or team up in local co-op for up to four, the challenge is real. Roam vast landscapes where day gives way to night, winter encroaches, and nature slowly reclaims deserted cities. Experience dynamic events such as reactivating power plants and transforming trains into mobile bases for transport and supplies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your survival hinges on every choice\u2014from scavenging for scarce resources and crafting weapons to constructing fortified shelters by felling trees and sawing wood. Navigate treacherous terrain in physics-driven vehicles while honing your skills in carpentry, cooking, farming, fishing, and more\u2014all while battling hunger, thirst, illness, and other hardships.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986460/extras/34953d7ea4d8ad22f77857d45b4c692a.poster.avif?t=1741280786\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_a