86\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986460/extras/6a87fe4b07d3c6f3df2024617cd03f7e.mp4?t=1741280786\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WHAT YOU GET</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong>For those new to this brutal realm, a brief story mode offers a gripping introduction, teaching you the survival basics while immersing you in the harsh realities of <i>Death Remains</i>. Choose how you want to play:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Singleplayer Tutorial</strong>: Learn the ropes at your own pace.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Co-op</strong>: Team up with friends to endure the dangers together.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiplayer</strong>: Put your survival instincts to the test in high-stakes encounters against other players.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join our Discord for more information!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986460/extras/d2b15f2c7bc0d98c713734b5264aecbb.poster.avif?t=1741280786\" width=688 height=386 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986460/extras/d2b15f2c7bc0d98c713734b5264aecbb.webm?t=1741280786\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986460/extras/d2b15f2c7bc0d98c713734b5264aecbb.mp4?t=1741280786\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986460/extras/f016f06502ba92c4b950fb707ce0f2d0.poster.avif?t=1741280786\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.